PKG=less
NAME=less 704 - the backward-scrolling pager
ARCH=Amiga
VERSION=704-2
CATEGORY=utility
CLASSES=none
VENDOR=amix-packages
# Authored PSTAMP -- an unset one leaks the build host into a distributed file.
PSTAMP=amix-packages-less-704-2
# Fills a genuine gap: stock Amix pagers are more/pg/page only.  less adds
# backward scroll, incremental search and no-write paging.  Regex is the SVR4
# regcmp backend (libgen); terminal control is the termcap API via libcurses,
# which on SVR4 reads the terminfo database.
DESC=less 704, the pager with backward scroll and incremental search -- stock Amix has only more/pg/page. Installs /opt/amix/bin/{less,lesskey,lessecho}. Uses the SVR4 regcmp regex (libgen) and the termcap API via libcurses; links nothing outside the stock system libraries. Add /opt/amix/bin to PATH to use it.
